WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From Warrior I with the right foot forward, bring the palms together at the heart.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Exhale and hook the left elbow outside the right thigh.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Press the palms, lift the chest, and extend the top elbow skyward.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Reach the top arm forward past the ear if stable, back heel pressing down or heel lifted.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Unwind and switch sides.
